cmu-trait-alcoholic-name = Alcoholic
cmu-trait-alcoholic-desc = You drink heavily and your body depends on it. Go too long without a drink and you'll start craving one; if you don't get one, your hands will begin shaking until you drink again.
cmu-alcoholic-onset = You could really use a drink right now.
cmu-alcoholic-craving = You need a drink. Badly.
cmu-alcoholic-shake = Your hands tremble without a drink.
cmu-alcoholic-satisfied = The drink takes the edge off and your hands steady.
cmu-alert-alcoholcraving-name = Alcohol Craving
cmu-alert-alcoholcraving-desc = You need a drink. Any alcohol will do.

cmu-trait-drugaddict-name = Drug Addict
cmu-trait-drugaddict-desc = You're hooked, whether on street drugs or prescription painkillers. Go too long without a fix and you'll start craving one; if you don't get it, you'll begin shaking uncontrollably until you use again.
cmu-drugaddict-onset = You start thinking about your next fix.
cmu-drugaddict-craving = You need a fix, now.
cmu-drugaddict-shake = You break into a cold sweat and your hands start shaking.
cmu-drugaddict-satisfied = The rush hits and the shaking finally stops.
cmu-alert-drugcraving-name = Drug Craving
cmu-alert-drugcraving-desc = You need a fix. Space drugs, stimulants or opioid painkillers will do.
